OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fcloudy with further outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Fthrough the evening then becoming
OL,8,Fmainly dry later in the night.
OL,9,FModerate to fresh winds easing
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FThere will be variable
OL,13,Famounts of cloud with bright spells
OL,14,Fand the odd light scattered shower.
OL,15,FLight winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRather
OL,18,Funsettled with with showers or longer
OL,19,Fspells of rain at times but also some
OL,20,Fdrier and brighter interludes.
